WEBVTT

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:02.590
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:06.890
Ai acquired SOL Technologies’s code keys.

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:10.100
SOL Technologies is under his control.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.100
Ai is up to something.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:14.500
Can we find Ai?

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.470
That’s not possible.

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:19.670
I was dreaming.

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:24.110
And I felt great and melted into space!

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:30.850
It’s a dream that you’ve 
become one with the universe!

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:36.860
That’s right!  Only the chosen 
AI can see that legendary dream!

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:39.330
The dream of a conqueror!

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:44.400
Since you worked hard in our recent 
mission, I’ll give you a country.

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:50.910
Hooray!  I’m the owner of my own domain!

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.250
Roboppi...

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:56.140
I'll also give you this.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:00.380
What is it?

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:02.780
Don’t worry about it.

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:05.120
Now go, Roboppi!

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:09.990
Bye, Roboppi.

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:17.010
Hooray!  My own country!

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:20.100
Are you citizens of my country?

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:24.070
Roboppi, what are you doing here?

00:01:24.070 --> 00:01:26.110
This is my country.

00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:28.050
A country of appliances!

00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:31.050
Soulburner, you’re not an appliance.

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:33.680
So leave immediately!

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:38.390
If you defeat me, I’ll 
tell you where Bro is.

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:42.370
Fine.  I’ll be your opponent.

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:52.900
calling & feeling  I take your 
thoughts to heart  VRAINS

00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:20.860
The data storm grazes my cheek, 
so I can't open my eyes

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:30.810
What are we trying to find?  
Where are we trying to go?

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:36.050
I won't make anyone sad anymore

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:44.590
I'll retrieve you  Let's go and look ahead

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:49.730
By meeting you, the world is in color

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:55.400
I'll protect you with an unseen bond

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:59.710
calling  With invisible wings

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:10.320
Destroy the dark and weakness within me

00:03:21.190 --> 00:03:25.660
I can’t believe Roboppi turned into that.

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:47.920
Roboppi!

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:52.880
My former master Playmaker has arrived.

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:55.880
But this is my country.

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:57.220
Leave now!

00:03:57.850 --> 00:04:01.080
Bro told me to protect my country.

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:02.860
I'll erase everyone in my way!

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:05.730
Where’s Ai?

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:08.740
That’s what we’re battling for.

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:11.360
He’ll tell me if I win this duel.

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:12.970
That’s right.

00:04:12.970 --> 00:04:16.900
But it’s foolish to battle me.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:19.850
Because I've changed!

00:04:19.850 --> 00:04:22.720
I'm very smart now!

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:24.950
What did Ai do to you?

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:30.500
Bro and I linked when he fought Bohman.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:33.690
That's when I became smart.

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:37.160
Ai’s backup affected you.

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:42.640
By becoming smart, I know lots 
of things!  It feels great!

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:45.640
I can understand that.

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:48.040
Because I’m not that smart either.

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:52.610
If I was, I'd see the world 
in a different light.

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:56.530
But there’s no use begging 
for something I don’t have.

00:04:56.530 --> 00:05:00.590
I’m happy with who I am.

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:04.860
I see.  Soulburner, that’s fine.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:09.600
I used to be happy because 
I didn’t know anything.

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:12.330
I’m the same as you, Soulburner!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:14.700
You’re not happy right now?

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:16.190
I'm happy.

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:20.810
But it’s a totally different 
happiness than yours, Soulburner.

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:26.300
With AI abilities, I can 
calculate and know everything!

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:29.480
I can learn anything if I have the data!

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:31.930
Even the end of the universe!

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:35.790
That’s why I’m now different 
than you, Soulburner!

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:39.260
Are you making fun of me?

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:46.260
I wish I could let you 
know what’s in my head.

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:50.470
But I don’t think you'll 
understand, Soulburner.

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:53.470
You are making fun of me.

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:56.940
You act like you know everything.

00:05:56.940 --> 00:05:59.950
That’s why AIs with free will are scary.

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:04.040
Living creatures must adapt to 
their environment to survive.

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:06.920
But AIs don’t.

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:11.890
If free will can't be contained, 
it’s hard to stop it yourself.

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:18.030
That’s why AIs with free will 
must walk alongside humans!

00:06:18.030 --> 00:06:22.150
AIs don’t need to walk alongside humans.

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:24.510
We'll walk on our own!

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:31.480
Playmaker, if you disapprove of us, I'll 
take you on after I defeat Soulburner!

00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:33.270
Roboppi…

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:36.450
That’s not going to happen.

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:39.450
Because I don’t intend to lose!

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:41.370
I’m going all out!

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:43.390
Don’t hold back!

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:48.260
Everyone, all together now!

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:51.970
Do your best, Roboppi!

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:56.200
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:01.310
I summon Salamangreat Gazelle!

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:07.010
Gazelle’s effect activates!

00:07:07.010 --> 00:07:09.750
I send Spinny from my deck to my graveyard!

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:12.750
Spinny’s effect activates 
from the graveyard!

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:16.760
When there’s another Salamangreat 
on the field, I can Special Summon it!

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:24.710
I use Level 3 Gazelle and Spinny 
to build the Overlay Network!

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:44.290
Xyz Summon!

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:50.760
The flaming wild horse that 
cuts through illusions!

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:55.830
Rank 3 Salamangreat Miragestallio!

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:00.430
Miragestallio’s effect activates!

00:08:00.430 --> 00:08:03.390
By using one Overlay Unit...

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:08.380
...I Special Summon a Salamangreat 
from my deck in defense position!

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:12.370
Come, Salamangreat Jack Jaguar!

00:08:12.950 --> 00:08:14.420
Link Summon!

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:23.600
Appear!  Link 2 Salamangreat Sunlight Wolf!

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:28.580
When Miragestallio is Xyz Summoned and sent

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:32.250
to the graveyard to Link 
Summon a Salamangreat...

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:35.540
...I return one monster 
on the field to the hand!

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:39.010
I return Propelion to your hand!

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:41.180
How audacious!

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:45.010
Then I'll activate the Quick-Play 
Spell, Appliancer Coating!

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:50.450
I negate an effect that's 
used against an Appliancer.

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:52.800
And I draw one card from my deck.

00:08:53.690 --> 00:08:58.340
Then I'll activate Jack Jaguar’s 
effect from my graveyard!

00:08:58.340 --> 00:09:02.130
I return Miragestallio from 
my graveyard to my Extra Deck.

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:04.540
And Special Summon Jack Jaguar!

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:09.820
Sunlight Wolf’s effect activates!

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:13.030
Since a monster was Special 
Summoned next to its link...

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:16.010
...I add Gazelle from 
my graveyard to my hand!

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:20.980
For someone who isn't smart, 
your deck works well.

00:09:20.980 --> 00:09:24.950
My deck is only getting started!

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:26.920
Link Summon!

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:33.630
Appear, Link 1 Salamangreat Balelynx!

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:36.000
Balelynx’s effect activates!

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:40.230
I add Salamangreat Sanctuary 
from my deck to my hand!

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:42.010
I’m not done!

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:45.040
Appear!  The circuit that changes the future!

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:50.710
The summoning conditions are at 
least two Fire Effect Monsters!

00:09:51.410 --> 00:09:52.880
Link Summon!

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:58.290
Appear, Link 3 Salamangreat Heatleo!

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:00.890
Heatleo’s effect activates!

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:04.970
I return one of your spell 
or trap cards to your deck!

00:10:04.970 --> 00:10:07.220
Resounding Roar!

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:14.270
You keep using effects that return cards!

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:17.670
I activate the Field Spell, 
Salamangreat Sanctuary!

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:24.350
When Link Summoining a Salamangreat, I can 
use a monster with the same name to Link Summon!

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:27.660
I’ve heard rumors about this!

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:39.130
Surging flame, awaken true strength 
with the power of purification!

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:41.570
Reincarnation Link Summon!

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:45.600
Be reborn, Salamangreat Heatleo!

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:48.440
So this is Reincarnation Link Summon!

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:55.950
How fun!

00:10:55.950 --> 00:10:59.180
A lion battle between Propelion and Heatleo!

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:03.080
Which one is the true king of beasts?

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:15.990
Roboppi has Celtopus on his field with 0 ATK.

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:19.880
But according to Pandor’s 
data, when Celtopus is linked...

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:25.010
...it can’t be attacked 
or be targeted by effects.

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:26.470
In that case…

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:30.840
I activate Reincarnation Link 
Summoned Heatleo's effect!

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:37.920
I select Balelynx in my graveyard to make 
Propelion’s ATK become the same as it - 500!

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:40.130
Flame Possession!

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:48.560
That's not enough to shake me!

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:53.460
When the monster co-linked 
to Celtopus battles...

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:59.010
...it gains 1000 ATK for every 
monster co-linked to Celtopus!

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:05.780
You lowered its ATK, but Propelion 
essentially has 2500 ATK!

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:08.480
It won’t lose to Heatleo!

00:12:08.480 --> 00:12:10.760
I know that!

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:17.960
I equip the Equip Spells, Salamangreat 
Claw and Salamangreat Fang on Heatleo!

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:28.740
The monster equipped with Fang gains 300 
ATK for every Link Marker on my field!

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:39.180
Due to Salamangreat Claw’s effect, Heatleo 
can attack your monsters three times!

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:44.080
Here I go, Roboppi!  Battle!

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:47.220
Heatleo attacks Propelion!

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:51.030
Celtopus’s effect activates!

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:54.360
Propelion gains ATK!

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:55.940
Octopus Charge!

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:59.930
And Propelion’s effect!

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:05.160
When a monster attacks Propelion 
when it’s co-linked...

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:07.670
...that monster’s ATK 
are halved during battle!

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:20.470
But the monster equipped with 
Claw can’t be destroyed!

00:13:20.470 --> 00:13:26.360
Now Propelion’s effect ends, so 
Heatleo’s ATK return to normal!

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:31.160
Celtopus’s effect also ends!

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:33.960
Propelion’s ATK return to normal!

00:13:37.470 --> 00:13:41.140
Heatleo attacks Propelion for a second time!

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:43.110
Heat Soul!

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:47.580
Propelion’s ATK rise again!

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:49.580
Octopus Charge!

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:53.790
But this time, I win!

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:06.700
Heatleo won the lion battle.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:10.440
Salamangreat Fang’s 
additional effect activates!

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:16.430
When the Reincarnation Link Monster equipped 
with this card destroys a monster in battle...

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:20.540
...you take damage equal 
to half its original ATK!

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:29.720
Heatleo attacks Vacculephant 
with its third attack!

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:31.850
Heat Soul!

00:14:34.460 --> 00:14:39.840
Due to Celtopus’s effect, 
Vacculephant gains 1000 ATK!

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:53.380
Due to Fang’s effect, you take damage 
equal to half of Vacculephant’s original ATK!

00:14:58.190 --> 00:15:00.700
Impressive, Takeru.

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:03.660
You quickly cornered Roboppi.

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:06.630
I end my turn!

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:08.600
Roboppi…

00:15:12.230 --> 00:15:16.300
It seems I underestimated Soulburner a bit.

00:15:16.300 --> 00:15:19.270
I'm fine stopping the duel.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:23.560
If you tell me where Ai is.

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:28.980
You think I’ll betray my Bro?

00:15:28.980 --> 00:15:34.720
Soulburner, I’ll defeat you for my Bro!

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:38.980
Do you really owe Ai that much gratitude?

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:44.200
You can find your own path 
to live together with humans!

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:49.190
Bro showed me a new world.

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:53.670
I'll repay his kindness by defeating 
the one who torments him!

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:56.780
I’m tormenting Ai?

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:00.400
That’s right!

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:04.740
Soulburner, if you protected Flame...

00:16:04.740 --> 00:16:07.720
...Bro wouldn’t have 
had to erase his friends.

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:12.690
Bro is tormented because he feels it's 
his fault that his friends are gone!

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:16.400
It's so sad that I can't look at him!

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:20.200
It’s your fault!

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:23.870
I hate you for tormenting my Bro!

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:27.530
Roboppi, nothing could've been done.

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:31.350
There was no other way to defeat Bohman.

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:34.350
Ai knows that too.

00:16:34.350 --> 00:16:39.670
He might know, but I don’t.

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:41.920
And I don’t intend to know!

00:16:41.920 --> 00:16:44.890
You won’t even try to know?

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:53.370
Even if he's suddenly smart, his 
heart can’t mature as fast.

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:58.840
Roboppi’s heart can’t keep up, 
so he can’t control his emotions.

00:16:58.840 --> 00:17:01.830
I'll defeat you!

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:03.310
Here I go!

00:17:03.310 --> 00:17:06.780
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:11.800
I summon Appliancer Socketroll!

00:17:13.710 --> 00:17:14.960
Link Summon!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:24.540
Appear, Link 1 Appliancer Kappa Scale!

00:17:25.530 --> 00:17:29.530
The Field Spell, Electrilyrical 
World’s effect!

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:38.610
I return Socketroll from 
my graveyard to my hand!

00:17:38.610 --> 00:17:40.850
Kappa Scale’s effect!

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:45.080
When it’s co-linked, by tributing itself...

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:49.560
...I can Special Summon an Appliancer 
Link Monster from my graveyard!

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:52.530
Resurrect, Propelion!

00:17:55.760 --> 00:18:00.030
Appear!  The circuit that guides me!

00:18:01.690 --> 00:18:03.170
Link Summon!

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:09.140
Appear!  Link 1 Appliancer Laundry Dragon!

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:14.280
Pandor had data on this monster, but…

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:20.950
A human brain can't quickly 
remember everything in my deck!

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:25.390
Battle!  Laundry Dragon attacks Heatleo!

00:18:26.550 --> 00:18:29.640
Heatleo has 3200 ATK!

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:33.570
But if he’s attacking, that 
monster must have an effect!

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:37.640
Of course!  First, Celtopus’s effect!

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:39.480
Octopus Charge!

00:18:43.840 --> 00:18:46.620
But that's not enough ATK.

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:49.490
You'll learn, Soulburner.

00:18:49.490 --> 00:18:53.690
Laundry Dragon’s co-linked effect ctivates!

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:58.060
When it battles, we both 
take 0 battle damage!

00:18:58.060 --> 00:19:01.630
Then the battling monsters are banished!

00:19:01.630 --> 00:19:04.600
That’s a really dangerous effect!

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:19.010
I activate the Quick-Play Spell, 
Appliancer Recycle from my hand!

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:24.120
When your monster leaves the field 
due to battle or an effect...

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:27.980
...I banish a monster from 
both of our graveyards!

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:31.960
I banish Kappa Scale from my graveyard!

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:36.930
And I banish Balelynx from your graveyard!

00:19:36.930 --> 00:19:41.890
Then I Special Summon an 
Appliancer from my graveyard.

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:47.670
And you Special Summon 
a banished Link Monster!

00:19:47.670 --> 00:19:54.410
The monster Special Summoned due to this 
effect can’t be destroyed in battle this turn!

00:19:54.410 --> 00:19:57.600
I Special Summon Heatleo!

00:19:59.520 --> 00:20:03.850
I Special Summon Laundry Dragon!

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:08.120
I attack again!

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:11.800
Laundry Dragon attacks Heatleo!

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:16.280
Laundry Dragon’s non-co-linked effect!

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:21.410
When it battles your monster, 
battle damage becomes 0!

00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:28.010
And your monster is destroyed, and you 
take damage equal to its original ATK!

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:39.970
When Appliancer Recycle affects Laundry 
Dragon, it can’t be destroyed in battle!

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:53.100
If Balelynx was in the 
graveyard, it could've negated

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:56.820
Salamangreat's destruction 
from battle or effect.

00:20:57.280 --> 00:20:59.750
But he knew that.

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:04.720
But I activate Salamangreat 
Lemming's effect from my hand!

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:10.090
By sending it to the graveyard, I 
Special Summon Gazelle from my hand!

00:21:13.190 --> 00:21:15.430
Gazelle’s effect activates!

00:21:15.430 --> 00:21:19.400
I send a Salamangreat in 
my deck to my graveyard!

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:25.140
I activate the spell card, 
Appliancer Reduce from my hand!

00:21:25.140 --> 00:21:30.600
All monsters you Special Summoned 
this turn are banished!

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:32.850
What?

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:39.790
Then I draw a card from my deck for every 
