00:22:59.870 --> 00:23:09.060
We helplessly sing for someone we can't reach

00:23:09.680 --> 00:23:14.490
Are you ready?

00:23:14.990 --> 00:23:19.840
Oh oh oh

00:23:20.360 --> 00:23:25.060
